{
  "id": "DEU.15",
  "number": "15",
  "bookId": "DEU",
  "reference": "Obwijukiro 15",
  "verseCount": 23,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "15",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "DEU 15"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "15",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 15:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Aha nzindo ya buli myaka mushanju ogarulirega ab'olikutonga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.15.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.15.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 15:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Emigarulilire niy'egi: Buli muntu ahozire ondijo, eky'ahozire akitaishure; atakitonga mutahiwe anga murumunawe Omwisiraeli, aha rw'okuba Omukama naba arangire kutaishura amabanja. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.15.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.15.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 15:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omunyamahanga ogwo wakumutonga; kyonka murumuna wawe k'araba ina eibanja lyawe olileke otalimutonga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.15.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.15.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 15:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omukama alibaha omugisha omu nsi eyo mulikuturamu. Thaliho Mwisiraeli alinakwara. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.15.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.15.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 15:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "K'olihulira eiraka ly'Omukama Ruhanga wawe, okegendeleza kukwata emihango egi yona eyo ndikukuragira kir'eki, omugisha ogwo oligubona. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.15.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.15.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 15:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omukama Ruhanga wawe alikuha omugisha nk'okwo yakuraganisize. Olihora amahanga gangi kyonkai iwe otalyehoza. Olitwara amahanga gangi kyonkai iwe tigalikutwara.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.15.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.15.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 15:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.15.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.15.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 15:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Omu kyaro kyawe kimoiho omu nsi ey'Omukama Ruhanga wawe alikukuha, kahalibamu Omwisiraeli wanyu omunaku, otaligumanganisa mutima gwawe, anga kwima murumuna wawe omunaku. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.15.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.15.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 15:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oikilize omujune, omuhore ebigaine obwetagebwe, n'orwo kyakuba kintuki. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.15.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.15.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 15:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oyelinde otalitekeleza aha mutima okagamba oti, ‘Omwaka gwa mushanju ogw'okugarulira amabanja guli haihi,’ aho murumuna wawe omunaku okamuleba kubi okanga kumuhora. K'alitakira Omukama nakukeena, olikwatwa omushango. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.15.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.15.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 15:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omuhore obuzira kumutonga, mara otamuha nogurubana, Omukama aije ahe omugisha emilimo yawe yona. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.15.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.15.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 15:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abanaku tibalihwa mu nsi; aha rw'ekyo ninkuragira nti, obumbuturulire murumuna wawe ekiganja; omwetage n'omunaku omu nsi obajune.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.15.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.15.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 15:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.15.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.15.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 15:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Kabalikuguza murumuna wawe Omuheburania anga Omuheburaniakazi, akukolere emyaka mukaga, kyonkai omu gwa mushanju omutaishure egende bwegelere. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.15.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.15.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 15:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mara otalimutaishura akagenda ngaro zishai; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.15.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.15.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 15:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "omugilire ekisha, omulebere omu buhyo bwawe bw'entaama, aha rwano rwawe, n'omw'ijungiro lyawe ly'edivai. Okw'Omukama Ruhanga wawe aliba akuhaire omugisha obe nikwo omuha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.15.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.15.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 15:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Olijuka okwo wabaire oli mwiru omu nsi ya Misiri, n'okwo Omukama Ruhanga wawe yakuchungwire. Aha rw'ekyo ninkuragira ntyo kir'eki. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.15.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.15.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 15:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kyonkai k'alikugambira ati, ‘Tindikwija kukurugaho,’ aha rw'okukugonza n'omuntungo gwawe aha rw'okuba nimwikaranwage, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.15.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.15.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 15:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "aho olikwata empindu omufumure okutwi ekuturukirane ekwate omu rwigi; abe atyo mwiru wawe ebiro byona. Omuzana wawe nawe omugilire otyo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.15.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.15.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 15:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ekyo kitalikugumira. Orwo olimutaishura kugenda bwegelere, kuba aliba yakukoleire emyaka mukaga, aliba asaine emperwa y'omukozi emirundi ebili. Kityo eby'orakoraga byona Omukama Ruhanga wawe alibiha omugisha.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.15.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.15.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 15:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.15.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.15.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 15:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Emizigaijo y'obunumi n'obupaya obulizarwa omu buhyo bwawe obw'ente n'obw'entaama, olibuhongera Omukama Ruhanga wawe. Omuzigaijo gw'ekitunganwa kyawe otaligukoza mulimo, kandi omuzigaijo gwawe gw'entama otaligushara bwoya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.15.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.15.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 15:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ogulye n'omutungo gwawe omu maisho g'Omukama Ruhanga wawe buli mwaka aha mwanya ogw'Omukama alironda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.15.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.15.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 15:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kyonkai kaguliba gwina akamogo, gulemaire anga guhumire, anga gwinai akamogo kona kona ak'amani, otaligutambira Mukama Ruhanga wawe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.15.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.15.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 15:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oguliire omu ka yawe. Omuntu ahagaire n'atahagaire kumoi, yakugulya nk'okwo yakubaire eli njobe anga nyemera. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.15.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.15.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 15:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ekiliho otaliguliirana na bwamba bwagwo; obusheshe ahansi nk'amaizi.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.15.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.15.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
